###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The text gives 2.27 meV/atom for MLIP (9-7-3-2-2) with Fig. 2a and 2.10 meV/atom for the same label with Fig. 2b; the first (with the matching 2.23 training error) is encoded. The p_max = 2, 3 and symmetrized errors are read as test errors because Fig. 2 plots test RMS errors.
# - Phonon RMS errors, vacancy formation and grain-boundary energies (Table IV) are properties. The cluster-functional AFS MLIP of Table IV has no stated energy error.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/seko2019.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

